    "file_name": "XIN_ENG_20061128.0420.tml",
    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061128.0420\n\nAMMAN, Nov. 28 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nJordanian king reiterates support for Lebanon\n\n\n\n\nJordanian King Abdullah II reiterated on Tuesday that Jordan will continue its support for Lebanon, the official Petra news agency reported.\n\nDuring a phone talk with Lebanese Prime Minister Fouad Seniora, the king said that all Lebanese people should unify their efforts and work to preserve unity of Lebanon in critical circumstances in order to face challenges.\n\nSeniora briefed the king on the latest developments in Lebanon and efforts to surmount the current political crisis, while appreciating Jordan's support.",
